  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Apparently FormLiveUpdate base form was broken; only LiveUpdateStarting(), LiveUpdateEverySecond(), LiveUpdateEveryMinute() and LiveUpdateStopping() were called quickly, but LiveUpdateEveryQuarterHour() and LiveUpdateEveryHour() were only called after the relevant amount of time, not when showing the form for the first time. This meant that some first time initialization of the form (and repeated updates after longer times) were not done until a quarter of a hour or a full hour would have elapsed.",
